{"id":"vod_zy360_67138","vodId":"67138","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"魔术快斗普通话版","name_cn":"魔术快斗普通话版","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241029-1/111f2b966fda79309291a78111680e45.jpg"},"summary":"白色斗篷、高礼帽，单片夹鼻眼镜。出现在午夜的高楼，留下拿走宝石的通知函。这是我们熟知的怪盗基德。在《名侦探柯南》里，他是不亚于工藤新一和江户川柯南的明星人物。而他的真实身份则是高中生黑羽快斗（山口胜平配音），为了调查父亲的失踪事件，扮起了父亲之前扮演的角色——怪盗基德，希望引出神秘组织的出现，进而调查出事情的真相。《魔术快斗》首次连载在《少年SUNDAY》上是1987年，中途停载了数次，至今仍未完结。号称杂志上连载时间最长的漫画。由于怪盗基德经常性在柯南里客串，以至于很多人都误认为这是柯南的原创人物，其实基德有其正篇漫画，从其诞生时间来看，他比柯南更早出现，漫画里则有很多奇幻因素，而基德的性格也有所不同。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-29 16:19:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/OEDSAVeP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/XshCrpiC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/7Psk0E8l/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/78TkM3Ac/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/JN7NmT8V/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/sKTiCGTF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/p9t4YX6i/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/iGwm4WZE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/DCqSdjBW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/KrN6zIja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/uXzLdi16/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241028/QEEmJvSL/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:24:20.334Z"}